    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A 3D-printed closed-top tailor's thimble with a debossed grip surface — the domed cap that rides the middle finger and drives a hand needle through heavy cloth. Sized from a measured finger girth rather than a retail size run, so a maker prints their own fit.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Un dedal de sastre de copa cerrada impreso en 3D con superficie de agarre rehundida — la cúpula que monta en el dedo medio y empuja la aguja a través de tela pesada. Dimensionado a partir de un contorno de dedo medido, no de un tallaje comercial.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/thimble.webp",
    "difficulty": "beginner",
