    "societal_benefit": {
      "en": "A thimble that fits is the difference between hand-finishing a garment and giving up on it. Retail thimbles come in a coarse size run that fits few hands; measured from a finger girth, this one is printed to fit, in any material a maker has.",
      "es": "Un dedal que ajusta es la diferencia entre rematar una prenda a mano y abandonarla. Los dedales comerciales vienen en un tallaje grueso que a pocas manos ajusta; medido desde el contorno del dedo, este se imprime a la medida, en cualquier material disponible."
    },
